From 3c4551bf9d3f42413a2b91d72bb98044b9b43a36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GGEZUS <coelho.b.ricardo@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 19:40:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 19/19] feat(gestures): derive the tap/flick tier from fingers

The tap-4/swipe-4-up/swipe-4-down nodes become tap-more/swipe-more-up/
swipe-more-down and apply at one finger more than touchscreen-swipe.fingers
(4 by default) instead of a hardcoded four or more. fingers is now
restricted to 3 or 4 at parse time: lower counts clash with standard
touchscreen behavior and higher counts push the second tier past
one-handed use.
